      <h2 id="csi-about_persistent-storage-csi-google-cloud-file" class="group scroll-mt-20">About CSI<a href="#csi-about_persistent-storage-csi-google-cloud-file" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
      <p class="_abstract">The Container Storage Interface (CSI) enables storage vendors to deliver plugins through a standard interface without modifying Kubernetes core code, replacing traditional embedded storage drivers.</p>
